Binding of Isaac is a difficult-but-rewarding iterative take on old school Zelda-style dungeon exploring. Replayability is high, as each of your sometimes-brief playthroughs will feature random dungeon layouts and item drops. A few downsides are occasional glitches and the lack of an in-game item database, but these small issues barely detract from the excellent design and gameplay!
